From 5f3fdeb43dda332cde1d343f902015b4d79aa1f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pierre Kisters <pierrekisters@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:31:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] refactor(bridge): import_file moves to its own module

static_tools.py is 794 lines against the 800-line cap, and import_file with
its poll loop is the one tool in it that is not about instances or tool
groups. A move only: the tool, its poll and its tests are unchanged; the
tests patch asyncio in the new module.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
